      "title": "Rina and the Rainy Morning",
      "body": [
        "It is seven o'clock on Monday morning. Rina looks out of her window. The sky is grey, and it is raining hard. She does not want to be late for school, so she puts on her blue raincoat and takes her umbrella.",
        "On the way to school, Rina meets her friend Dina. Dina has no umbrella, and her shirt is getting wet. Rina smiles and says, 'Come under my umbrella!' The two friends walk together and jump over the big puddles on the road.",
        "They arrive at school at seven thirty. Their shoes are a little wet, but their clothes are dry. 'Thank you, Rina,' says Dina. Rina laughs. 'That is what friends are for.'"
      ],
